<style>.tag{color:#73dcc2;font:13px monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px}.continuous-example .controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:18px 0}.continuous-example button{cursor:pointer;background:#243442;color:#eaf4fa;border:1px solid #486170;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 14px;font:inherit}.continuous-example button.primary{background:#93e5bf;color:#102b25;border:0}.continuous-example button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:wait}#scene{height:60vh;min-height:350px;max-height:650px;position:relative;background:#8ab4c6;border:1px solid #4c6878;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}#scene canvas.rumoca-interactive-canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}#hud{color:#f1f7fb;position:absolute;left:18px;top:15px;pointer-events:none;background:#101b25d9;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;font:14px/1.7 monospace;white-space:pre-line}#label{position:absolute;right:16px;top:15px;background:#102a20dd;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;color:#a5efcc;max-width:50%}.continuous-example .stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;padding:15px 0}.continuous-example .stats b{display:block;color:var(--fg);font-size:24px}.continuous-example .stats span{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg);opacity:.7}#curve{width:100%;height:150px;border:1px solid #384e5e;border-radius:8px}.continuous-example section{max-width:850px;margin-top:28px}.continuous-example code{background:#23333e;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:4px}#notice{min-height:26px;color:#ffce8c}
#scene:fullscreen{width:100vw;height:100vh;max-height:none;border-radius:0}</style>
<div class="continuous-example"><div class="controls"><button id="replay" class="primary">Replay trained flight</button><button id="train">Train from scratch</button><button id="watch">Watch training in real time</button><button id="camera">Overview camera</button><button id="topdown">Top-down camera</button><button id="paths">Toggle paths (P)</button><button id="network">Toggle neural net (N)</button><button id="fullscreen">Fullscreen</button></div>
<p>Drag to orbit · right-drag to pan · pinch/scroll to zoom · T: training speed · F: fullscreen. N hides the actor panel and keeps the occupancy map.</p>
